OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife rescue group opposes new
OL,4,Aangling club plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wildlife rescue organisation said it
OL,7,Fwas "disappointed" that plans for a new
OL,8,Fangling club were being considered by
OL,9,Fcouncillors just days after a cygnet
OL,10,Fwas found with a fishing hook in its
OL,11,Fbeak.
OL,13,FBrambles Wildlife Rescue (BWR) said the
OL,14,Finjured bird was discovered in the lake
OL,15,Fat Stanley Park in Blackpool on Friday.
OL,17,FStating that there had been an increase
OL,18,Fin fishing-related wildlife deaths
OL,19,Frecently, BWR suggested now was "not
OL,20,Fthe time" to be encouraging more
OL,21,Fangling in the lake.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
