OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife rescue group opposes new
OL,4,Aangling club plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Blackpool Council spokesperson said
OL,7,Fthe potential angling club would act to
OL,8,Fset up rules about fishing responsibly
OL,9,Fand prevent water birds from getting
OL,10,Fentangled in lines.
